  "details": "Having all these extra checkboxes to enable drones, stickers, etc, are great, but having it be \"the next popup\" just to instantiate a new world is kind of a regressive workflow.  My suggestion is that you add these checkbox settings on the same dialog box which you choose the access level (ie, public, invite, friends, etc).  Just make the checkbox area smaller and put them at the bottom of the dialog box.\n\nAfter all, I usually go with the default settings (all checked), so having to click OK one more time for a followup dialog box is kind of annoying.",
